<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家布団.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Before I knew it, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> was breathing softly in her sleep.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No wonder, after today's hard schedule.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I let my guard down, I'd fall asleep too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... are you there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm right here. What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Really... is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> the culprit...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"...No, he isn't. So don't worry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> was lying beside <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE>.<PG>
Just now, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> had clearly said 'No.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though, as far as I knew, she had told <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> earlier that <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> was the culprit.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... I'm coming in."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... So </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> fell asleep."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> seemed to have sobered up completely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The succession rite, or whatever it was, must have put her in a serious frame of mind as well.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, do you have a moment?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I glanced over at <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, go ahead. I'll stay with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> a little longer."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I went down to the living room, <STYLE ID="7">Obaasan</STYLE> was there too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. Were you asleep?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"No, I've been thinking things over this whole time..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hmm... Sounds like you heard a lot from </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shirozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. A little while ago, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shirozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> came by here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> did?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="7">"He asked me to give this to you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\桜の枝.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Set on the table was a cherry branch bearing many blossoms.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\The_Covert.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Apparently he helped himself to a cherry tree nearby while you were shopping at the convenience store, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But he went back and forth a long time over handing it to you, he said, wondering if it would mean lending a hand to a witch. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shirozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> made up his mind. That he'd trust you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">..."</STYLE><PG>
I picked up the cherry branch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It wasn't an imitation. It was a real cherry branch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt the warmth particular to wood, and a scent of cherry blossoms that the human sense of smell normally can't detect drifted faintly through my nose.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shirozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, too... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">lost his wife to the curse-killings..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"To the curse-killings...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shirozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> hates the culprit more than anyone else in this settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">No... he must hate himself too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Maybe he's grown sick of a life where he alone goes on living without a care. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">That's why </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shirozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> must want to catch them no matter what."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that was it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If he once accepted me as a witch, Shirozaki-san would hate me, and then, sooner or later, the intent to kill.<PG>
So that he wouldn't be driven by that impulse, he had been refusing to listen to any talk of witches.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, to hold himself back, Shirozaki-san had left a knife with me...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At last, all of Shirozaki-san's actions <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ふ">made sense</STYLE>.<PG>
I had words that <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> had entrusted to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">'The culprit being unknown is the background,'</STYLE> she had said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In my own reading, this means not a single person knows the truth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, there is no culprit.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> told me! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'The culprit being unknown is the background,'</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> she said!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　What does that mean?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカうつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Then <STYLE ID="7">Obaasan</STYLE> looked down and fell silent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she had only gone silent, it would probably have meant 'What is this nonsense?'...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But looking down meant something must have come to her mind.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"In this incident... there's no such thing as a 'true culprit.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Everyone's a victim, and everyone's a suspect. That's all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Suspicion feeds on itself, and people kill their neighbors. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">That's all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Wait a minute! Then you're saying you've turned a blind eye to it all this time!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　The head of the settlement</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, forgiven for something like that? Is that what you think!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカうつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"That's right, it's nothing that can be forgiven... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">No one knows who did the killing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">That leaves only one conclusion: I can only think that, with suspicion feeding on itself, people lay hands on whoever seems suspicious. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Everyone comes up with reasons and hunts for the culprit, but deep down they must know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">'This time, I might be the one who kills.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">I didn't have the nerve to hand the ones who got scared and lashed out over to the police."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then...! If everyone kept watching each other the whole time...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Then it would have to be all year, not just April, or there'd be no point. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Keeping watch on everyone 24 hours a day, 365 days a year... that's asking too much."</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then... the only thing left is to break up the settlement..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Yes, I've said that too, at times. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">But nobody will leave this place. To the people of Arata, this land weighs more than their lives."</STYLE><PG>
I remembered what Shirozaki-san had said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For people rooted in a place like this, the place where they were born and raised matters more than their lives.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Depending on the country or region, it's even an asset that starts wars and gets fought over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If everyone is staying on this land because they want to, then isn't it impossible to solve the curse-killings in the first place?<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, if you're going to blame </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, then I'm just as guilty. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I haven't been able to do anything either. I should have just reported it to the police in secret or something... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But I thought </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> might be the culprit... so I just couldn't..."</STYLE><PG>
I admit that, because it's such a small settlement, its people have lived like one family, and that under the motto 'One for all, all for one,' it has lasted for hundreds of years until now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that's wrong...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They must have known that leaving it alone would only lead to something even more horrible...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, tomorrow, once the thirteenth-year memorial service is over, let's go to the police. All right?" [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... It has to end now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yes... You're right. Let's do that..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"But there must have been something that set it off, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　The first person killed in the curse-killings was </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s wife. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">What on earth happened? Was it because </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> died?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"If I had to say, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> was as good as killed by </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="おきて">the rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Maybe there was someone who tried to change such a behind-the-times settlement in a ruinous way. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">That person cut off </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s head and set off the next year's curse-killings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">The rest, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, is what you heard from </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shirozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. Distrust breeds distrust, and people get killed as if by </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s curse. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s head was cut off by someone who may already have been curse-killed, though..."</STYLE><PG>
That's ridiculous! All it would take is avoiding the curse-killing just once...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To begin with, does distrust really chain together so conveniently that someone gets killed every year?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Residents <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="つ">possessed</STYLE> by the 'cursed thinking' Shirozaki-san talked about might think so.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But to me, a chain of murders that neat doesn't feel real.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"For that, I need your power, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">You can hear the voices of the cherry trees, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. If you could just hear how to avoid the curse-killings... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But what I didn't count on is that the cherry tree in the garden can't get its voice to you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">That's why </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shirozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... this."</STYLE><PG>
The cherry branch Shirozaki-san had delivered―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everything depends on this and my intuition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I can find a way for everyone to avoid danger, there won't be any more curse-killings.<PG>
Even the culprits who did the curse-killings don't know who the culprits of the other years were.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No one knows who will be the next culprit.<PG>
Caught in suspicion feeding on itself, killing others to protect your own life―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The curse-killing: through cursed thinking, peace can come only from killing someone else.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the curse called attachment to this land is one of its causes too.<PG>
―When I looked at the clock, it had already gone past midnight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
April 8―the anniversary of <STYLE ID="14">Ojisan</STYLE>'s death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Bring that cherry branch to the memorial service tomorrow. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Everyone should be </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="そろ">gathered</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> there, so you should be able to tell who'll be in danger next."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"All right... I hope the wind blows just right, though..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカうつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Obaasan</STYLE>'s shoulders slumped heavily.
{PAUSE ""}
